<title>USA: XATA Corp Q2 March 31 net declines.</title>
<headline>XATA Corp Q2 March 31 net declines.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended March 31,</p>
<p>							1997	    1996</p>
<p> Net sales				   $2,632,375    $2,428,942</p>
<p> Gross profit				 1,284,679     1,117,909</p>
<p> Operating income				 6,427	 312,418</p>
<p> Net income					22,517	 380,125</p>
<p> Net income per share			     .01	     .09</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding  4,421,885     4,306,114</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago Q2 includes $0.04 a share federal and state income tax benefit from use of loss carryforwards.</p>
<p>					     Six Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p> Net sales				   $5,112,450    $4,718,685</p>
<p> Gross profit				 2,508,688     2,094,104</p>
<p> Operating income				11,465	 576,076</p>
<p> Net income					49,270	 650,851</p>
<p> Net income per share			     .01	     .16</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding  4,502,724     4,029,611</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago six-month results include $0.06 a share tax benefit.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
